          "reasons": [
           {
            "@type": "meaningComprehension",
            "comprehends": [
             "copies/fr853pn6519#inscription"
            ],
            "note": "Graded low on the figures of the date: the figures could give another date. Pencil. Region 1 holds only the five-digit group 22324, no separators and no name; region 2 has the roll's number 419 on its own, regions 3 and 4 are blank. Read as 22.3.24 on the pattern reading.md gives for 14114 = 14.1.1914, but the group could equally be a serial or order number. Same layout as ty610zx2946 in this batch, which carries 28622 in region 1 and its number 416 elsewhere."
           }
          ]
         }
        }
       },
       "medium": "pencil"
      }
     ]
    }
